{"_id":"40rP0PRJtFkMSyj0","img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/shared/pukwudgie.webp","items":[{"_id":"hzAD0q71nN1lkiVO","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","name":"Primal Innate Spells","sort":100000,"system":{"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"description":{"value":""},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"proficiency":{"value":1},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":""},"rules":[],"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"slots":{},"slug":null,"spelldc":{"dc":25,"value":17},"tradition":{"value":"primal"},"traits":{},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spellcastingEntry","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!40rP0PRJtFkMSyj0.hzAD0q71nN1lkiVO"},{"_id":"WZWMBHRgvQvdTOBt","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.HBJPsonQnWcC3qdX"},"img":"icons/environment/wilderness/cave-entrance-vulcano.webp","name":"Mirage","sort":200000,"system":{"area":{"type":"burst","value":50},"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You create an illusion that causes natural terrain to look, sound, feel, and smell like a different kind of terrain. This doesn't disguise any structures or creatures in the area.</p>\n<p>Any creature that touches the illusion or uses the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} action to examine it can attempt to disbelieve your illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> Your image can also disguise structures or create illusory structures (but still doesn't disguise creatures).</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"until your next daily preparations"},"level":{"value":4},"location":{"heightenedLevel":4,"value":"hzAD0q71nN1lkiVO"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"500 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"mirage","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"],"value":["concentrate","illusion","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!40rP0PRJtFkMSyj0.WZWMBHRgvQvdTOBt"},{"_id":"l2hYHP4cOYImVdvP","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.aqRYNoSvxsVfqglH"},"img":"icons/equipment/feet/boots-leather-laced-brown.webp","name":"Unfettered Movement","sort":300000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>You repel effects that would hinder a creature or slow its movement. While under this spell's effect, the target ignores effects that would give them a circumstance penalty to Speed. When they attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} an effect that has them @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}, they automatically succeed unless the effect is magical and of a higher rank than the <em>unfettered movement</em> spell.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.CdAyAiMGESvgNQtz]{Spell Effect: Unfettered Movement}</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"10 minutes"},"level":{"value":4},"location":{"heightenedLevel":4,"value":"hzAD0q71nN1lkiVO"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"unfettered-movement","target":{"value":"1 creature touched"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!40rP0PRJtFkMSyj0.l2hYHP4cOYImVdvP"},{"_id":"tYLgXaVtJNSgndKC","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.KsWhliKfUs3IpW3c"},"img":"icons/magic/nature/root-vine-entangled-humanoid.webp","name":"Wall of Thorns","sort":400000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"3d4","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"piercing"}},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Over the course of a minute, you cause a thick wall of thorny brambles to grow from the ground. You create a 5-foot-thick wall of brambles and thorns in a straight line up to 60 feet long and 10 feet high. You must create the wall in an unbroken open space so its edges don't pass through any creatures or objects, or the spell is lost. The wall stands vertically. If you wish, the wall can be of a shorter length or height. Everything on each side of the wall has cover from creatures on the opposite side, and the wall's spaces are difficult terrain. For every move action a creature uses to enter at least one of the wall's spaces, that creature takes 3d4 piercing damage.</p>\n<p>Each 10-foot-by-10-foot section of the wall has AC 10, Hardness 10, and 20 Hit Points. It's immune to critical hits and precision damage. A destroyed section can be moved through freely.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The Hit Points of each section of the wall increase by 5, and the piercing damage increases by 1d4.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"1 minute"},"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"},"level":{"value":3},"location":{"heightenedLevel":3,"value":"hzAD0q71nN1lkiVO"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"wall-of-thorns","target":{"value":""},"time":{"value":"3"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","plant","wood"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!40rP0PRJtFkMSyj0.tYLgXaVtJNSgndKC"},{"_id":"lGFDmPhDxFNEVo95","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XXqE1eY3w3z6xJCB"},"img":"icons/creatures/magical/construct-stone-earth-gray.webp","name":"Invisibility (At Will) (Self Only)","sort":500000,"system":{"area":null,"cost":{"value":""},"counteraction":false,"damage":{},"defense":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Illusions bend light around the target, rendering it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.zJxUflt9np0q4yML]{Invisible}. This makes it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected} to all creatures, though the creatures can attempt to find the target, making it @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.iU0fEDdBp3rXpTMC]{Hidden} to them instead. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends after that hostile action is completed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell lasts 1 minute, but it doesn't end if the target uses a hostile action.</p>"},"duration":{"sustained":false,"value":"10 minutes"},"level":{"value":2},"location":{"heightenedLevel":2,"value":"hzAD0q71nN1lkiVO"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"requirements":"","rules":[],"slug":"invisibility","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"time":{"value":"2"},"traits":{"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"],"value":["illusion","manipulate","subtle"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"spell","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!40rP0PRJtFkMSyj0.lGFDmPhDxFNEVo95"},{"_id":"PDk5irePkj7swYlp","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumS